en:
"No doubt it says
'Sweet Shirinmoriiin~'{w}or some such nonsense again."{w}{p}"Honestly, in that sweltering getup, how does Radrecht
have the face to write love letters to the Water Sage?{w}...Well, with that face, I suppose."{w}{p}"Don't worry about it.{w}It's been like this forever..."{w}{p}"...Forever?{w}Oh? Come to think of it, I...{w}Since when have I been here... and why...?"{w}{p}"How strange. I can't remember...{w}Ugh, how creepy...{w}It's all because Radrecht sent me that thing!!"{w}

"How odd, young lord.
The bungee rope and the cushion
are nowhere to be found. Whatever shall we do?"{w}

"Well, if there's no cushion, something
like a Zabutoon will do."{w}{p}"As for the bungee rope, that alchemist freeloading
on the floor below probably knows something."{w}

The Chief Retainer and the Ogre Knight
pushed the chore onto you
and went off somewhere.{w}

As the Ogre Knight started clapping,
the goblins and ogres nearby gradually gathered,
and before long the Prince was completely surrounded.{w}

With a shout, the Goblin Prince snatched
the bungee rope and cushion from your hands,
clutched them in both arms... and suddenly jumped!!{w}
